method.description:
Spawns a copy of [member owner]'s scene under [param parent], which defaults to the owner's own parent. [param id] sets the copy's [member entity_id].
[param configure] receives the copy's [NetwEntity] before it is sent, so what it sets reaches every peer with the spawn.
[codeblock]
var mob := entity.spawn_under($World/Mobs, &"skeleton_1")
var wild := entity.spawn_under()   # same parent as template
var boss := entity.spawn_under($World/Mobs, &"boss", func(e: NetwEntity) -> void:
    e.owner.hp = 500
)
[/codeblock]
The server may call it, and so may a client when the copy's [member lifecycle] is [constant LIFECYCLE_CONTROLLER]. That client becomes the copy's [member controller].

members.member:
Who controls the entity when it spawns. Set it in the root's [code]_init[/code].
[codeblock]
func _init() -> void:
    var entity := Netw.configure_entity(self)
    entity.initial_controller = NetwEntity.INITIAL_REPRESENTED_PEER
[/codeblock]

What happens to this entity when an entity above it is despawned with [method despawn]. A parent freed without [method despawn] frees this entity too.
[codeblock]
func _init() -> void:
    var entity := Netw.configure_entity(self)
    entity.on_parent_despawn = NetwEntity.PARENT_DESPAWN_DETACH
[/codeblock]

signal.description:
Emitted on the server when the [member controller] of a [constant LIFECYCLE_CONTROLLER] entity spawns, despawns or moves it, before other peers see the change. Calling [method NetwLifecycleRequest.deny] on [param request] refuses it.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
func _init() -> void:
    Netw.configure_entity(self).lifecycle_requested.connect(judge)


func judge(peer_id: int, request: NetwLifecycleRequest) -> void:
    if request.destination is Backpack and request.destination.is_full():
        request.deny("backpack full")
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
public Crate()
{
    Netw.ConfigureEntity(this).LifecycleRequested += Judge;
}

private void Judge(long peerId, Variant request)
{
    var asked = request.As<NetwLifecycleRequest>();
    if (asked.Destination is Backpack backpack && backpack.IsFull())
        asked.Deny("backpack full");
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
On a spawn the entity has not entered the tree yet, so [member NetwLifecycleRequest.destination] is where it will go.
